@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
node "Demonstration computer" {
 node "Web browser" as Browser {
  artifact "React / TypeScript compiled JS + CSS" as UI
 }
 node "Python 3.11+ HTTPServer\n127.0.0.1:8000" as Server {
  artifact "prototype package" as App
  artifact "ui/dist static assets" as Static
  artifact "In-memory session store" as Session
 }
 artifact "SQLite file\nrecords + BLOBs" as Data
}
Browser --> Server : same-origin HTTP\n/ui/ and /api/*
App --> Data : sqlite3 file I/O
App --> Session : session resolution
Server --> Static : serves files
note bottom of Data
Fictional records; no cloud services.
Node/Vite required only to build assets.
end note
@enduml
